# The agent token: helpers send it as `Authorization: Bearer <token>` to brain serve.
# It lives at ~/.config/brain/agent-token (or $BRAIN_AGENT_TOKEN_FILE), mode 600. Never commit the real file.
#
# Make or change it: POST /api/agent-token with the owner token. The answer shows the new token once.
# Revoke it: DELETE /api/agent-token with the owner token. Helpers get 401 from the next call.
# You can also put one long random line below this comment by hand. The server reads the file on each call.
#
# Lines that start with # are skipped. With no token line, every helper call gets 401.
# A helper may make 120 calls a minute. Past that it gets 429 and a Retry-After.
